  "snippet": "## Weather and Climate in Tokyo in May\n\n   Temperature: 16-22°C (61-72°F)\n   Rainy days: 8 days\n   Humidity: 66%\n   Feeling: Warm, but not hot\n\nImage 3: Our clients at the Robot Restaurant in TokyoUeno Park in Tokyo\n\nMay is the final month of spring in Tokyo, with warmer weatherand more sunny days.\n\nTokyo enjoys delightful weather in May, with temperatures ranging from 16-22°C (61-72°F). Days are warm, while mornings and evenings remain cool.\n\nHowever, the weather can vary greatly. You might have hot days or cool days within the same month. For example, in mid-May 2025, Tokyo was hot, perfect for wearing short sleeves.Yet, just a week later, the weather cooled down, requiring a light jacket. [...] Japan Weather in December 2026: How to Experience Japan's Winter Magic and Snow [...] # Tokyo Weather in May 2026: Not Too Hot, Not Too Crowded\n\n   Image 1: Japan Highlights logo\n   Japan Tours\n\n       Family Tours\n       Cherry Blossom Tours\n       Japan Autumn Tours\n       Skiing and Snowboarding Tours\n\n   Japan Destinations\n\n       Tokyo\n       Kyoto\n       Osaka\n       Hakone\n       Hiroshima\n       Kanazawa\n       Hokkaido\n       Nagano\n       Shikoku\n\n   Experiences\n\n       Cherry Blossoms\n       Autumn Colors\n       Skiing\n       Anime\n       Theme Parks\n       Onsen\n       Mt. Fuji\n       Geisha\n       Samurai\n       Ryokan\n       Hiking\n       Food\n\n   About Us\n\n       Meet Our Team\n       Reviews (★★★★★ 5/5)\n       Responsible Travel\n       Loyalty Program\n\n   Start Your Journey\n    \n\nImage 2: Tokyo Weather in May 2026: Not Too Hot, Not Too Crowded"
